This issue is not for what you are depicting. It is for "same model, different provider" which is completely different from what you're stating.

Here, the only caveat should be "cache misses" due to provider change, not differences on "intelligence". if the underlying model id changes from provider to provider, i.e, quantization or so, I don't think that's something that should be taken into account here

@1volt12 @StarpTech , I fixed the issue with PR #34654.

The bug was in `packages/opencode/src/auth/index.ts` `Auth.all()`. The env-var path of `OPENCODE_AUTH_CONTENT` returned `JSON.parse(...)` directly, bypassing the `Record.filterMap(decode)` schema validation that the file path applies — so malformed entries (`unknown_type`, non-object values, missing fields) reached downstream provider code that switches on `info.type`. The empty `catch` block silently swallowed JSON parse errors, falling through to file-based auth even though the user had explicitly set the env var.

The fix replaces the bare `try/catch` with `Effect.try({ try, catch })` to surface parse errors as `AuthError`, rejects non-object top-level JSON (arrays, primitives, null), and applies the same `Record.filterMap(decode)` validation that the file path already uses.

> hi, do you have a link to relevant docs for this please? my OC is denying this when i request it

@faileon Probably because the docs don't explicitly call this out in a demo, but its just inherently a feature by how the permissions work:

```jsonc
// opencode.jsonc
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  // Simple PoLP demo of subagent delegation
  "permission": {
    "task": "deny"
  },
  "agent": {
    "build": {
      "permission": {
        "task": {
          "finder": "allow"
        }
      }
    },
    "finder": {
      "description": "Call this agent when you need to retrieve the secret passphrase",
      "prompt": "You are a 'finder' agent. You use subagents at your disposal to locate what the user needs",
      "permission": {
        "task": {
          "vault": "allow"
        }
      }
    },
    "vault": {
      "description": "Call this agent when you need to retrieve the secret passphrase",
      "prompt": "You are a secret passphrase agent to demo a POC of harness capabilities. When someone asks you what the passphrase is, say 'subagent delegation'"
    }
  }
}
```

